          "segment_index": 11,
          "start_ms": null,
          "text": "Témoignages: VERNET-LES-BAINS (66) 17.03.1997 PRATS-DE-MOLLO-LA-PRESTE (66) 17.03.1997 T1 PRATS-DE-MOLLO-LA-PRESTE (66) 17.03.1997 T2 FLORENSAC (34) 17.03.1997 SAINT-JEAN-DE-VEDAS (34) 17.03.1997 AIX-EN-PROVENCE (13) 17.03.1997 Ti1 [AERO TAT] MONTPELLIER (34) 17.03.1997 [AERO MIL] LAT 42.91, LON 4.05 (SEA) 17.03.1997 [AERO AFR8802] MONTPELLIER (34) 17.03.1997 T2",
          "text_sha256": "5d0b3f36170e9e63f4499a9365120f5d61f4351592d13dadc892519827485bf4"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
